HYMNS  OF  GURU  NANAK  381

The  following  has  reference  to  the  concremation ,
of  widows  : —

Nanak,  the  widow  followeth  her  husband  and  dieth  ;  she
hath  no  power  to  live.

But  she  who  dieth  struck  by  the  news  of  her  husband’s
death  is  acceptable.

